[B]NeoModeration 1.3.1 — Polish[/B]

A quick usability release. No moderation behavior changes.

[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]/nmod help[/FONT] is now grouped into Getting started / Rules & actions / Tools / Admin sections with short, scannable descriptions — no more wall of wrapped text.
[*]Every message shares one locale-defined prefix, so you can rebrand or recolor the whole plugin from a single line in [FONT=Courier New]locale/en_US.yml[/FONT].
[*]Internal cleanup: shared code paths for commands, scheduling, and config handling. Same behavior, verified by the same 61-test suite and the four-version Paper live matrix.
[/LIST]

Update whenever convenient. If you are new here: install, run [FONT=Courier New]/nmod doctor[/FONT], try [FONT=Courier New]/nmod test <message>[/FONT], and enable enforcement with [FONT=Courier New]/nmod mode enforce[/FONT] when you like the decisions.
